# coredll6-x86.def -- COREDLL export surface for Windows CE (Akari API).
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Akari API contributors
# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
#
# Export names and ordinals are OS interface facts dictated by
# coredll.dll itself; transcribed from the device-dump-audited export
# surface of the verified toolchain sysroot (audit-coredll.py,
# kagurasumusun/cellvm-build).  No third-party expression is included.
# No name is invented here: include/ headers declare only names present
# in this surface (see docs/inventory.md).
